<title>JAPAN: Chugai Pharm to issue 25 bln yen CB.</title>
<headline>Chugai Pharm to issue 25 bln yen CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Chugai Pharmaceutical Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Nomura Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p>TRUSTEE - Sumitomo Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE convertible     ISSUE NO   6	  AMT   25 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE PAR	 MATURITY 30.Sep.08</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 1.Nov.96   CONV TO 29.Sep.08</p>
<p> LAST MOODY	     PAY DATE 19.Sep.96  INT PAY end Mar/Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 11.Sep-18.Sep</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon and conversion price will be decided on September 10.</p>
</text>
